      <h3>What do you do?</h3>
      <h4>We teach German – Online</h4>
      <p><strong>German for Nurses (Pflegedeutsch)</strong></p>
      <p>
        There is essentially two ways to become eligible for a Work Visa in
        Germany. One is to learn German Allgemein (general German) and one is
        to learn German Pflegedeutsch (medical language – for nurses only).
      </p>
      <p>
        We offer our nurses the latter – German Pflegedeutsch! It takes 4
        different levels or classes to be admitted to the final B2 Test.
      </p>
      <p><em>Update: Since 2021 also a passed B1 Test can be accepted.</em></p>
